sequenceDiagram
 participant P as Reader / page
 participant Y as Yomitan
 participant U as Popup
 participant B as Local bridge
 participant J as TypeSafe JEV
 P->>Y: Shift-hover; extract sentence + exact surface offset
 Note over Y: Deinflect + installed dictionary lookup
 Y->>U: Render all senses in original order
 Y->>B: Sentence, target, reading, surface, offset, all candidate sense text
 B->>J: Key-authenticated constrained choice; senses + unclear
 J-->>B: Choice + distribution
 Note over B: Validate IDs, probabilities and choice
 B-->>Y: Validated mapped result
 alt Current popup and non-unclear choice
 Y->>U: Highlight chosen original sense
 else Failed, stale, invalid or unclear
 Note over U: Ordinary popup remains usable
 end
